msgid "　　山火事は、雨が消し止めたようで　　　　　青木達が外にでた時は警察、消防隊　　　　霊撮隊や報道陣が集まっていた・・・"
msgstr "The rain seemed to have put out the forest fire. When Aoki and the others came outside, the police, firefighters, ghost-filming crew and the press had gathered..."

#. event 186, page 1 | screen 128, cell (0,4)
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "IVENT06/e186/p1/t23"
msgid "　　スッキリ晴れた空は朱色に染まり　　　　　空気は冷たくて心地よい・・・"
msgstr "The sky had cleared and was dyed vermilion, and the air was cold and pleasant..."

#. event 186, page 1 | screen 128, cell (0,4)
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "IVENT06/e186/p1/t24"
msgid "　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　報道陣に囲まれながら、警察に保護され病院へ向かう青木、美広、若月（？）・・・。　"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Surrounded by the press, Aoki, Bihiro and Wakatsuki (?) are taken into police care and head for the hospital..."

#. event 186, page 1 | screen 128, cell (0,4)
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "IVENT06/e186/p1/t25"
msgid "若月寺と根岸霊廟は山火事で完全に焼け落ちていた。　学園も４分の１が大破と判明。　現在、復旧のメドはたっていない。"
msgstr "Wakatsuki Temple and the Negishi Mausoleum burned down completely in the forest fire. A quarter of the school was found to be wrecked. There is currently no prospect of restoration."

#. event 186, page 1 | screen 128, cell (0,4)
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "IVENT06/e186/p1/t26"
msgid "　　　　　　千歳：ちとせ　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　ガレキの中から遺体で発見。"
msgstr ""
"{center}Chitose\n"
"\n"
"{center}Found dead in the rubble."

#. event 186, page 1 | screen 128, cell (0,4)
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "IVENT06/e186/p1/t27"
msgid "　　　　　　　伊達：だて　　　　　　　　　　　　遺体損傷が著しいが発見。　　　　　　　千歳と折り重なるような形で。"
msgstr ""
"{center}Date\n"
"{center}Found, though the body was badly damaged.\n"
"{center}Lying as if folded over Chitose."

#. event 186, page 1 | screen 128, cell (0,4)
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "IVENT06/e186/p1/t28"
msgid "　　　　　学長：若月きりゆ　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　遺体は見つからなかった。"
msgstr ""
"{center}Principal: Kiriyu Wakatsuki\n"
"\n"
"{center}Her body was never found."

#. event 186, page 1 | screen 128, cell (0,4)
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "IVENT06/e186/p1/t29"
msgid "　　　　若月みおみ：本名、不詳　　　　　　　　東北地方の某霊峰の奥の院で　　　　　　　死者のための結婚式を依頼。"
msgstr ""
"{center}Miomi Wakatsuki: real name unknown\n"
"At the inner sanctuary of a certain sacred mountain in Tohoku, she arranged a ghost marriage, a wedding for the dead."

#. event 186, page 1 | screen 128, cell (0,4)
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "IVENT06/e186/p1/t30"
msgid "　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　千歳と伊達のために"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"{center}For Chitose and Date"

#. event 186, page 1 | screen 128, cell (0,4)
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "IVENT06/e186/p1/t31"
msgid "　　　青木：あおき　　美広：びひろ　　　　病院の検査後、霊撮隊のしつこい取材を　　　　受けるハメになったが・・・"
msgstr ""
"{center}Aoki    Bihiro\n"
"After their hospital checkups they were stuck with persistent interviews from the ghost-filming crew, but..."

#. event 186, page 1 | screen 128, cell (0,4)
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "IVENT06/e186/p1/t32"
msgid "　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　［閉じ込められただけ］・・・と美広。　　［そういうこと］・・・・・・と青木。"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\"We just got locked in\"... said Bihiro.\n"
"\"That's all it was\"...... said Aoki."

#. event 186, page 1 | screen 128, cell (0,4)
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "IVENT06/e186/p1/t33"
msgid "　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　そして、二人は気づいた・・・"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"{center}And then the two of them noticed..."

#. event 186, page 1 | screen 128, cell (0,4)
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "IVENT06/e186/p1/t34"
msgid "　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　霊能力が少しずつ弱くなり"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"{center}that their psychic power grew weaker,"

#. event 186, page 1 | screen 128, cell (0,4)
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "IVENT06/e186/p1/t35"
msgid "　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　最後には消えてしまったことに"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"{center}little by little, and at last was gone."

